avenet). Long replies stream\nwith **gapless ad"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"aptive chunked playback**; voices install **one-click from a\nvoice-pack registry**; a **portable RVC"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" runtime** means no RVC WebUI install is needed."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> 📖 **First time? See the user guide (执行手册)** — every step\n> covers \"what / how / how to tell it wor"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ked\": read-aloud, RVC voices and\n> voice-pack downloads."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. **Read-aloud button** on every finalized assistant message (in the\ncopy / feedback / branch actio"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"n row): click to speak that message (the\nbutton shows an animated equalizer), click again to stop.\n2"},{"id":"p9s3","text":". **Auto-read toggle** in the composer tool row (between the command and the\naccess-mode buttons): w"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"hen on, every newly completed assistant reply is\nread aloud automatically (the toggle gets a circula"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"r highlight); when off,\nnothing is auto-read.\n3. **Voice settings panel** under 设置 → 插件 → 语音:\n- **TT"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"S provider**: Edge TTS (free, no API key) / custom RVC voice /\nlocal Index-TTS2 voice / local CosyVo"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ice clone / Google Cloud TTS (paid, API key)\n- **Voice**: 22 live-verified Edge TTS voices (default "},{"id":"p9s8","text":"晓萱 zh-CN-XiaoxuanNeural);\n8 Cloud voices in the cmn-CN group (default cmn-CN-Wavenet-A, free-form id"},{"id":"p9s9","text":" allowed)\n- **Sound tuning**: rate / pitch / volume (0 = default, shared by Edge & Cloud)\n- **RVC co"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"nfig**: service URL + model (.pth) / index (.index) picker, base voice,\nvoice tuning and advanced pa"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"rams — see the RVC Guide\n- **Index-TTS2 config**: service URL (default 7880) + reference-voice\npicke"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"r/refresh/upload + clean-text toggle + emotion control + sampling\nparams — see the Index-TTS2 Guide\n"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"- **CosyVoice config**: service URL (default 7890) + prompt-audio picker/refresh/upload +\nprompt tra"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"nscript (required, in order and in full) + speed (0.5–2.0) + seed (0 = random) —\nsee the CosyVoice G"},{"id":"p9s15","text":"uide\n- **Cloud config**: API Key (Host-file-only, write-only input) + Project ID (optional) +\ntest b"},{"id":"p9s16","text":"utton + this month's local usage per tier (Standard 4M / Wavenet-Neural2-Chirp3 1M) —\nsee the Cloud "},{"id":"p9s17","text":"Guide\n- **Voice packs**: one-click install of voices from a registry\n- **Preview**: type text and pr"},{"id":"p9s18","text":"ess the play (triangle) button — a spinning\nloader shows while it is synthesizing/playing (click aga"},{"id":"p9s19","text":"in to stop),\nfailures show an inline message.\n4. **RVC custom voices**: read with your own trained R"},{"id":"p9s20","text":"VC models, computed\nlocally (index-free mode, advanced params — see the\nRVC guide).\n5. **Gapless lon"},{"id":"p9s21","text":"g reads**: adaptive chunked progressive playback — probe-calibrated\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `web` profile (`dsh web`)\n- Node.js >= 22 (the worker uses the native `WebSocket`"},{"id":"p11s2","text":")\n- For **local-voice providers only** (nothing to install for Edge/Cloud):\n- **RVC custom voices**:"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" a local RVC inference environment (an RVC WebUI\nor the portable runtime) and a running `rvc-server."},{"id":"p11s4","text":"py` — see the\nRVC Guide → \"启动本地 RVC 服务\" and the\nUser Guide §4.2. macOS users start there too.\n- **In"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"dex-TTS2 voices**: the local `index-tts2-nvidia` bundle's API service\n(`启动api服务.bat`, default port 7"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"880) — see the\nIndex-TTS2 Guide.\n- **CosyVoice clones**: the local CosyVoice-2.0-0.5B bundle's `cosy"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"-server.py`\n(`启动cosy服务.bat`, default port 7890) — see the\nCosyVoice Guide."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Four equivalent ways (pick any one):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`; the plugin then loads automatically as a profile bundle.\nUninstalling any one of "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"the above first is required before installing another:\nthey all register the same loader entry id (`"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"tts`), and the installer refuses\nduplicates (it rolls back instead of overwriting)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Voices (live-verified, Edge TTS)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Region | Voices |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Simplified Chinese | Xiaoxuan 晓萱 · Xiaoyi 晓伊 · Yunxi 云希 · Yunyang 云扬 · Xiaoxiao 晓晓 · Yunjian 云健 · "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"Yunxia 云夏 · liaoning-Xiaobei 晓北 · shaanxi-Xiaoni 晓妮 |\n| Taiwan | HsiaoChen 曉臻 · HsiaoYu 曉雨 · YunJhe "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"雲哲 |\n| Hong Kong | HiuGaai 曉佳 · HiuMaan 曉曼 · WanLung 雲龍 |\n| English | Aria · Jenny · Guy · Sonia (UK"},{"id":"p18s4","text":") |\n| Other | Nanami 七海 (ja-JP) · SunHi (ko-KR) · Denise (fr-FR) |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Layer | Location | Role |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Host | `lib/index.mjs` | Registers webServer routes: `/dsh-tts-api/speak` (synthesis / chunk queue"},{"id":"p22s2","text":", all providers), `/dsh-tts-audio/<id>` (audio bytes), `/dsh-tts-api/rvc-next` (next chunk / job can"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"cel), `/dsh-tts-api/rvc-files` + `/rvc-compact-index` + `/rvc-packs*` (RVC service proxy / packs), `"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"/dsh-tts-api/index-*` and `/dsh-tts-api/cosy-*` (local service proxy + config), `/dsh-tts-api/cloud-"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"*` (Cloud key/usage/test), `/dsh-tts-api/notify` (approval-alert queue), `/dsh-tts-api/diagnose` (on"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"e-click diagnostics); runs a zero-dependency Edge worker via `node -e` |\n| Client | `lib/client.js` "},{"id":"p22s7","text":"| Web Audio chunk player (sample-accurate joins, `<audio>` fallback) in `shell.overlay` + the UI ent"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"ries (read-aloud button / auto-read toggle / settings panel); talks to the Host through `fetch` |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The TTS worker mirrors node-edge-tts@1.2.10:\n`Sec-MS-GEC` query params (ticks rounded to the 5-minut"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"e boundary),\n`Sec-MS-GEC-Version=1-143.0.3650.75`, `Path:audio` binary framing, `xml:lang`\nderived f"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"rom the voice locale, one retry on abnormal (1006) closures. Audio is\n`audio-24khz-48kbitrate-mono-m"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"the voice locale, one retry on abnormal (1006) closures. Audio is\n`audio-24khz-48kbitrate-mono-mp3`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
